nt of Medicine I, University Hospital Dresden, Dresden, Germany."}]}}, {"fullName": "Foersch S", "lastName": "Foersch", "firstName": "Sebastian", "initials": "S", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-4740-6900"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Institute of Pathology, University Medical Center Mainz, Mainz, Germany."}]}}, {"fullName": "Lammert J", "lastName": "Lammert", "firstName": "Jacqueline", "initials": "J", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-0380-574X"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Gynecology and Center for Hereditary Breast and Ovarian Cancer, University Hospital rechts der Isar, Technical University of Munich (TUM), Munich, Germany."}, {"affiliation": "Center for Personalized Medicine (ZPM), University Hospital rechts der Isar, Technical University of Munich (TUM), Munich, Germany."}, {"affiliation": "German Cancer Consortium (DKTK), Munich, Germany."}, {"affiliation": "European Network for Rare Cancers (EURACAN) Initiative, Munich, Germany."}]}}, {"fullName": "Tschochohei M", "lastName": "Tschochohei", "firstName": "Maximilian", "initials": "M", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Google Cloud, Munich, Germany."}]}}, {"fullName": "Jäger D", "lastName": "Jäger", "firstName": "Dirk", "initials": "D", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-1276-7802"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Medical Oncology, National Center for Tumor Diseases (NCT), Heidelberg University Hospital, Heidelberg, Germany."}]}}, {"fullName": "Salto-Tellez M", "lastName": "Salto-Tellez", "firstName": "Manuel", "initials": "M", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-8586-282X"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Integrated Pathology Unit, Institute for Cancer Research and Royal Marsden Hospital, London, UK."}]}}, {"fullName": "Schultz N", "lastName": "Schultz", "firstName": "Nikolaus", "initials": "N", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-0131-4904"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Epidemiology and Biostatistics, Memorial Sloan Kettering Cancer Center, New York, NY, USA."}]}}, {"fullName": "Truhn D", "lastName": "Truhn", "firstName": "Daniel", "initials": "D", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-9605-0728"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Diagnostic and Interventional Radiology, University Hospital Aachen, Aachen, Germany."}]}}, {"fullName": "Kather JN", "lastName": "Kather", "firstName": "Jakob Nikolas", "initials": "JN", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-3730-5348"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Medical Oncology, National Center for Tumor Diseases (NCT), Heidelberg University Hospital, Heidelberg, Germany. jakob-nikolas.kather@alumni.dkfz.de."}, {"affiliation": "Else Kroener Fresenius Center for Digital Health, Technical University Dresden, Dresden, Germany. jakob-nikolas.kather@alumni.dkfz.de."}]}}]}, "authorIdList": {"authorId": [{"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-8586-282X"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-0131-4904"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-0380-574X"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-0407-7617"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-1276-7802"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-3730-5348"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-4740-6900"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-6141-1263"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-9605-0728"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0009-0005-7029-0028"}]}, "dataLinksTagsList": {"dataLinkstag": ["altmetrics", "supporting_data"]}, "journalInfo": {"issue": "8", "volume": "6", "journalIssueId": 4002872, "dateOfPublication": "2025 Aug", "monthOfPublication": 8, "yearOfPublication": 2025, "journal": {"medlineAbbreviation": "Nat Cancer", "title": "Nature cancer", "essn": "2662-1347", "issn": "2662-1347", "nlmid": "101761119", "isoabbreviation": "Nat Cancer"}, "printPublicationDate": "2025-08-01"}, "pubYear": "2025", "pageInfo": "1337-1349", "abstractText": "Clinical decision-making in oncology is complex, requiring the integration of multimodal data and multidomain expertise. We developed and evaluated an autonomous clinical artificial intelligence (AI) agent leveraging GPT-4 with multimodal precision oncology tools to support personalized clinical decision-making. The system incorporates vision transformers for detecting microsatellite instability and KRAS and BRAF mutations from histopathology slides, MedSAM for radiological image segmentation and web-based search tools such as OncoKB, PubMed and Google. Evaluated on 20 realistic multimodal patient cases, the AI agent autonomously used appropriate tools with 87.5% accuracy, reached correct clinical conclusions in 91.0% of cases and accurately cited relevant oncology guidelines 75.5% of the time. Compared to GPT-4 alone, the integrated AI agent drastically improved decision-making accuracy from 30.3% to 87.2%. These findings demonstrate that integrating language models with precision oncology and search tools substantially enhances clinical accuracy, establishing a robust foundation for deploying AI-driven personalized oncology support systems.", "affiliation": "Department of Medical Oncology, National Center for Tumor Diseases (NCT), Heidelberg University Hospital, Heidelberg, Germany.", "publicationStatus": "ppublish", "language": "eng", "pubModel": "Print-Electronic", "pubTypeList": {"pubType": ["research-article", "Validation Study", "Journal Article"]}, "grantsList": {"grant": [{"agency": "National Institute for Health Research (NIHR)", "grantId": "NIHR213331", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "NCI NIH HHS", "acronym": "CA", "grantId": "U24 CA220457", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "NCI NIH HHS", "acronym": "CA", "gran